// ==UserScript==
// @name         Argon Survey Guard v13.5 (Access Control + Quiet Mode)
// @namespace    http://tampermonkey.net/
// !!! NEVER CHANGE @name OR @namespace AGAIN. Tampermonkey ties the saved data (Access ID, name, locks) to them.
// !!! A new @name = a NEW script = NEW Access ID + empty storage. Only change @version.
// @version      16.80
// @updateURL    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rohimgpt/argon-list/main/argon.user.js
// @downloadURL  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rohimgpt/argon-list/main/argon.user.js
// @description  Argon Survey Guard: repeat-survey detection (topic / question / option matching), admin blocklist, 7/15/30-day locks, sheet log. Changelog: see CHANGELOG.txt
// @match        *://*/*
// @noframes
// @grant        GM_setValue
// @grant        GM_getValue
// @grant        GM_getTab
// @grant        GM_saveTab
// @grant        GM_registerMenuCommand
// @grant        GM_unregisterMenuCommand
// @grant        GM_notification
// @grant        GM_xmlhttpRequest
// @grant        GM_openInTab
// @connect      raw.githubusercontent.com
// @connect      api.github.com
// @connect      argon-track.mdsam7997.workers.dev
// @connect      *
// @run-at       document-start
// ==/UserScript==
// SECURITY NOTE: network is used ONLY to (a) download the admin list (plain JSON data, never executed)
// (b) the manual "Check for update" menu item (reads the @version line of the script file only),
// (c) employee work report to your own server (client ID, employee name, access status, per survey: domain + duration; no full URLs / questions / answers), only if TRACK_URL is set (one report every 6 hours),
// (d) for the admin only: publish changes to that JSON file via the GitHub API, and read the report data from your own server,
// (e) v15.5: read-only GET of logo images (cross-origin) so a pixel fingerprint can be computed. Images are never executed or uploaded.
// No @require, no @resource, no eval.

